Added a CVSS Vector field to the CVE model. It holds the vector string of the score used for the CVSS Base Score.
Added the `cvss_vector` field to the CVE REST API and the CVE filters.
Added a CVSS Vector column to the CVE list view that can be enabled with the table's Configure option.
Added a pop-up to the CVE detail page that explains each metric in the CVSS vector string and links to the official CVSS calculator.
Added a Force CVE Updates option to the NIST CVE Search Job that updates every CVE from its NIST record, even if the CVE's Last Modified Date has not changed, so that existing CVEs can be filled in after upgrading.
Added validation to the CVSS Vector field on the CVE form that rejects unsupported CVSS versions and malformed or unknown metrics.
Added an info log message to the NIST CVE Search Job that names the source of the CVSS Base Score when the Job creates or updates a CVE using a score from a source other than NIST.
